# Overdue lists open blocks due before today, and leaves out due today, start dates, done blocks and blocks inside done ones.
file <<END
Work:
	- Late report @due({today-3})
	- Due today @due({today})
	- Started @start({today-2})
	- Finished @due({today-2}) @done({today-1})
	Closed: @done({today})
		- Inside closed @due({today-4})
	Old project: @due({today-1})
END
keys gO
see Overdue
see 3 days ago ·
see Yesterday ·
see - Late report  Work
see Old project:  Work
hide Due today
hide Started
hide Finished
hide Inside closed
